---
// Shopify Inventory Reservations MySQL Architecture Diagram Component
---

<figure class="sir-diag" aria-labelledby="sir-diag-caption">
  <svg
    class="sir-diag__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 480"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="sir-diag-title sir-diag-desc"
  >
    <title id="sir-diag-title">
      Shopify 庫存預扣架構：從 Redis 雙寫到 MySQL 8 SKIP LOCKED 演進
    </title>
    <desc id="sir-diag-desc">
      展示 Shopify 如何藉由將單一數量槽位重構為 1000
      上限的有界可用單元池，搭配複合主鍵、READ COMMITTED 隔離級別、SKIP LOCKED
      與 ProxySQL 連線標記治理，達成與總帳的單庫 ACID 一致性。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="sir-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="sir-diag__arrow-head"></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="sir-arrow-cyan"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="sir-diag__arrow-head--cyan"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="sir-arrow-gold"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="sir-diag__arrow-head--gold"
        ></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Block 1: Redis Legacy Pain (Why Migrate) -->
    <g class="sir-diag__card" transform="translate(30, 40)">
      <rect width="260" height="390" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="sir-diag__badge sir-diag__badge--rose" x="18" y="28"
        >LEGACY ARCHITECTURE</text
      >
      <text class="sir-diag__title" x="18" y="58">舊架構：Redis 雙系統痛點</text
      >
      <text class="sir-diag__desc" x="18" y="86"
        >• 預扣在 Redis (DECR/INCR)</text
      >
      <text class="sir-diag__desc" x="18" y="108">• 最終總帳在 MySQL</text>
      <text class="sir-diag__desc" x="18" y="130">• 缺乏原子跨系統事務</text>

      <g transform="translate(14, 150)">
        <rect
          width="232"
          height="216"
          rx="8"
          class="sir-diag__subcard sir-diag__subcard--danger"></rect>
        <text class="sir-diag__subhead sir-diag__subhead--rose" x="14" y="26"
          >跨系統非同步失步風險</text
        >
        <text class="sir-diag__code" x="14" y="52"
          >1. 支付成功 ➔ 扣 MySQL 失敗</text
        >
        <text class="sir-diag__subdesc" x="24" y="74"
          >導致超賣 (Overselling)</text
        >
        <text class="sir-diag__code" x="14" y="104"
          >2. 扣 MySQL 成功 ➔ 釋放 Redis 失敗</text
        >
        <text class="sir-diag__subdesc" x="24" y="126"
          >導致少賣 (Underselling)</text
        >
        <text class="sir-diag__code" x="14" y="156"
          >3. 多倉履約無感知 (Multi-Location)</text
        >
        <text class="sir-diag__subdesc" x="24" y="178"
          >獨立 Redis 叢集昂貴維運成本</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Block 2: MySQL Unit Pool & SKIP LOCKED -->
    <g class="sir-diag__card" transform="translate(330, 40)">
      <rect width="330" height="390" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="sir-diag__badge sir-diag__badge--cyan" x="18" y="28"
        >CORE INNOVATION</text
      >
      <text class="sir-diag__title" x="18" y="58"
        >MySQL 8: 單元池與非阻塞鎖</text
      >
      <text class="sir-diag__desc" x="18" y="86"
        >• 一件可賣單元 = 一筆資料列 (Unit Row)</text
      >
      <text class="sir-diag__desc" x="18" y="108"
        >• 1,000 上限有界單元池 (Bounded Pool)</text
      >
      <text class="sir-diag__desc" x="18" y="130"
        >• 單一資料庫同享完整 ACID 保障</text
      >

      <!-- Subcard: Database Schema & Locking -->
      <g transform="translate(14, 150)">
        <rect width="302" height="216" rx="8" class="sir-diag__subcard"></rect>
        <text class="sir-diag__subhead sir-diag__subhead--cyan" x="14" y="26"
          >關鍵技術決策矩陣</text
        >

        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <circle cx="24" cy="52" r="10" class="sir-diag__dot sir-diag__dot--cyan"
        ></circle>
        <text class="sir-diag__dot-text" x="24" y="56" text-anchor="middle"
          >1</text
        >
        <text class="sir-diag__item-title" x="42" y="50"
          >複合主鍵 (Composite PK)</text
        >
        <text class="sir-diag__item-desc" x="42" y="66"
          >(shop_id, item_id, group_id, id) 僅 1 個行鎖</text
        >

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <circle cx="24" cy="98" r="10" class="sir-diag__dot sir-diag__dot--cyan"
        ></circle>
        <text class="sir-diag__dot-text" x="24" y="102" text-anchor="middle"
          >2</text
        >
        <text class="sir-diag__item-title" x="42" y="96"
          >READ COMMITTED 隔離</text
        >
        <text class="sir-diag__item-desc" x="42" y="112"
          >消除 supremum 間隙鎖，避開補貨死鎖</text
        >

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <circle
          cx="24"
          cy="144"
          r="10"
          class="sir-diag__dot sir-diag__dot--cyan"></circle>
        <text class="sir-diag__dot-text" x="24" y="148" text-anchor="middle"
          >3</text
        >
        <text class="sir-diag__item-title" x="42" y="142"
          >固定加鎖順序 (Orderly Locking)</text
        >
        <text class="sir-diag__item-desc" x="42" y="158"
          >Reserve: DELETE pool ➔ INSERT reserve</text
        >

        <!-- Step 4 -->
        <circle
          cx="24"
          cy="190"
          r="10"
          class="sir-diag__dot sir-diag__dot--cyan"></circle>
        <text class="sir-diag__dot-text" x="24" y="194" text-anchor="middle"
          >4</text
        >
        <text class="sir-diag__item-title" x="42" y="188"
          >UNION ALL 跨商品批次合併</text
        >
        <text class="sir-diag__item-desc" x="42" y="204"
          >單次 RTT 完成整台購物車多項預扣</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Block 3: Production Bottleneck & ProxySQL Governance -->
    <g class="sir-diag__card" transform="translate(700, 40)">
      <rect width="230" height="390" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="sir-diag__badge sir-diag__badge--gold" x="18" y="28"
        >SYSTEM PLUMBING</text
      >
      <text class="sir-diag__title" x="18" y="58">連線治理與平滑切換</text>
      <text class="sir-diag__desc" x="18" y="86"
        >• 真正瓶頸在連線池持有時間</text
      >
      <text class="sir-diag__desc" x="18" y="108"
        >• 不是 CPU，而是管線水管塞滿</text
      >

      <g transform="translate(14, 150)">
        <rect
          width="202"
          height="216"
          rx="8"
          class="sir-diag__subcard sir-diag__subcard--gold"></rect>
        <text class="sir-diag__subhead sir-diag__subhead--gold" x="14" y="26"
          >管線觀測與影子切換</text
        >

        <text class="sir-diag__code" x="14" y="52">/* conn_tag:process */</text>
        <text class="sir-diag__subdesc" x="14" y="72">SQL 註解歸因持有時間</text
        >

        <text class="sir-diag__code" x="14" y="102">ProxySQL 聚合分析</text>
        <text class="sir-diag__subdesc" x="14" y="122"
          >精確抓出偷佔連線的業務鏈路</text
        >

        <text class="sir-diag__code" x="14" y="152">影子雙寫 (Shadow Mode)</text
        >
        <text class="sir-diag__subdesc" x="14" y="172"
          >雙寫比對結果，秒級 Kill-switch</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Flow Arrows -->
    <path
      d="M 290 230 L 330 230"
      class="sir-diag__arrow"
      marker-end="url(#sir-arrow-cyan)"></path>
    <path
      d="M 660 230 L 700 230"
      class="sir-diag__arrow"
      marker-end="url(#sir-arrow-gold)"></path>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile Layout: Vertical Semantic Cards -->
  <div class="sir-diag__mobile">
    <div class="sir-diag__card-mobile sir-diag__card-mobile--danger">
      <div class="sir-diag__badge sir-diag__badge--rose">01 · 舊架構痛點</div>
      <h4>Redis 雙系統一致性困局</h4>
      <p>
        預扣在 Redis (DECR)，扣減總帳在
        MySQL。兩者跨越兩個獨立叢集，缺乏分散式原子保證。極端併發或中斷時，可能導致超賣（扣款成功但總帳扣除失敗）或少賣（總帳扣除成功但預扣殘留）。此外缺乏多倉位感知。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="sir-diag__card-mobile sir-diag__card-mobile--cyan">
      <div class="sir-diag__badge sir-diag__badge--cyan">
        02 · MySQL 8 核心創新
      </div>
      <h4>單元池化與 SKIP LOCKED 解法</h4>
      <p>
        摒棄單一 row 數字累減爭搶，改採「每個庫存單位獨立一列」。建立上限 1,000
        的有界可用單元池，搭配 <code>SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED</code> 消除排隊阻塞。引進四大關鍵技術決策：
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>複合主鍵</strong>：(shop_id, item_id, group_id, id)
          將二級索引與聚簇索引鎖合一，降至單一鎖。
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>READ COMMITTED</strong>：消除 supremum
          間隙鎖，避開補貨事務死鎖。
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>固定鎖順序</strong>：Reserve 與 Claim
          統一鎖順序，打破循環等待。
        </li>
        <li><strong>UNION ALL 批次化</strong>：單次往返完成多項商品預扣。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="sir-diag__card-mobile sir-diag__card-mobile--gold">
      <div class="sir-diag__badge sir-diag__badge--gold">
        03 · 管線水利學與安全切換
      </div>
      <h4>連線治理與零中斷影子灰度</h4>
      <p>
        瓶頸往往不在 SQL
        執行時間，而在於非預扣邏輯佔用連線過久引發的連線池枯竭。Shopify 藉由 SQL
        標籤 (/* conn_tag */) 與 ProxySQL 聚合歸因，清理非必要查詢並調校 MySQL
        執行緒併發參數；並透過 Shadow Mode
        雙寫驗證業務正確性後平滑切換，保留隨時切回 Redis 的 Kill Switch。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="sir-diag-caption">
    圖解：Shopify
    庫存預扣架構演進歷程——從跨系統一致性困境到單一資料庫有界單元池與連線治理。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sir-diag {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .sir-diag__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .sir-diag__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  /* SVG Styles */
  .sir-diag__card > rect {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

